{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56071","headline":"寿邓将军 二 · 杜光庭","name":"寿邓将军 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当年五百合生贤，自入青云更不还。\n岳气此时来世上，文星今日到人间。\n降因天下悲姚宋，出爲儒门继闵颜。\n惟有感恩无路报，一生倾酒祝南山。\n（影印本《诗渊》第六册第四五四○页。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56071.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56071","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}